Subject: [PATCH 40/49] research29e: fills issued after the host kernel's own
 loads (mask 124: -0.40% ms/round)

---
 .../bf16/bf16_gdn_norm_gating_proj_27.cu      |  9 ++++----
 src/ops/gdn_input_proj/gdn_projected_conv.cu  |  9 ++++----
